From 51a8350bd2d1c80ca86552a7b44029a83be8936d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:33:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Let autopilot and remote Jump/Dock work when the client
 lands before the server's warp ends

The client and server time warps slightly differently, so the autopilot asks to
jump (or dock) the moment the client lands, often while the server is still
decelerating. The server refused with "You can't do this while warping" and the
autopilot never retried (EvEmu issue #263). Finish a warp that is already slowing
down onto the requested gate or station instead of refusing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GZgkReFMTa8JWavQEivVUA
